# The bench session's clean finish in the simulator: the re-verify run with
# stage 6's row failing (bench_sim set fail_s6, a must-pass step).  The
# video steps that need it (vs, vplay, vlong) skip by themselves (one
# "Skipping ahead" screen), and the session ends: no verified line, no clock150 token, each step
# once and in order.  ucop is held (19-9 retired), so the end clears the
# "cop" switch an earlier session left: the unit's next start runs the
# build default (the daily driver after the sitting).  The core layout
# probe (p2, p1, duty) needs nothing, so it still runs (the sim refuses it).
# Generated by scripts/bench_sim_script.py (s6fail); edit that, not this.
# needs: video
# golden: skip
# np: viz-full
# reset: viz
# nolog: vlong:
# log: ui switch cleared
# log: (ucop held)
# log: p2: Not run (sim)
# log: duty: Not run (sim)
# log: s1: Not run (sim)
# log: sd: Not run (sim)
# nolog: next start: ui cop
# nolog: glass owned STALE
# nolog: bench_sim: watchdog
# timeout: 300
wait 4000
bench_sim reset          # no results files, the model's defaults
bench_sim set fail_s6    # stage 6's row fails (a must-pass step)
bench_sim set ui_split cop  # an earlier session's switch
wheel +20 40            # the last row (Now Playing while music plays)
wait 400
wheel -1 200            # Settings
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 1200
key SELECT              # About
wait 1500
chord SELECT+LEFT 3200  # Developer
wait 1000
wheel +1 200            # Bench session
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 1200
wheel +40 10          # Re-verify the video image
wait 400
wheel -3 200
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 800
wheel +40 10          # the confirm screen: start
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 800
wheel +40 10          # Hands off now (pgrd, preg, awxm, prtc)
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 800
wheel +40 10          # Seconds counter: start
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 800
# -- boot (Display program): the restart
wheel +40 10          # Display program: start
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 800
wheel +40 10          # Now restart: close
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 800
key LEFT                # the stopped-session screen: leave
wait 800
shot boot_asked
reboot
